From 64e741cc6bee2f610736b101014ccc2f2bcc2626 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@localhost>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:43:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NV272: gemini-web va grok-web khoi dong duoc khi chua co
 cookie

Lop loi: module co kha nang tu dang nhap (manifest khai dang_nhap_bang)
bi loi chan o _tao_tu_kho vi thieu truong bi mat bat buoc, nen khong co
cho chay de dang nhap tu dong tu lay cookie ve (Google tra chua_ho_tro
vi gemini-web khong nam trong danh sach module dang chay).
Da grep cho cung lop: duyet modules/*/manifest.json, loc truong bat_buoc
co kieu chua 'bi_mat' -> 25 module; trong do 5 module khai dang_nhap_bang
(antigravity, chatgpt-web, claude-web, gemini-web, grok-web), 20 module
khong khai thi giu bat buoc nhu cu.
Theo nguyen tac (cau truc manifest), khong theo danh sach ten module/nha
cung cap trong loi: loi chi kiem tra manifest co dang_nhap_bang hay khong;
moi module tu tra can_dang_nhap khi chat chua co phien, khong phu thuoc cheo.
